<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφισ-τεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play the sophist, deal</i> or <i>argue as one</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				61.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				165a28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				14.6
			</span></i>; <i>occupy oneself with academic pursuits</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				2.9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.9.1
			</span></i>; <i>practise the profession of sophist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				172
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give lectures</i>, as the Sophists did, esp. in Rhetoric, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Caes.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀργυρίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.1047f
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰ ῥητορικά</span>
			<i>lecture in</i> rhetoric, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.223
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>devise artfully</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				6.9
			</span></i>: also, <i>conceal artfully, dissemble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἔρωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
